ScreenCoderDesktop

This product includes design work intended to integrate with or adapt ideas from ScreenCoder:
https://github.com/leigest519/ScreenCoder

ScreenCoder is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This repository includes a minimal runtime copy of ScreenCoder source files under
screencoder-core/ so the desktop application can run the real ScreenCoder pipeline.
The copied files retain the upstream Apache License, Version 2.0. Runtime patches are applied
to per-job working copies at execution time to inject model configuration and task-local paths.

ScreenCoderDesktop source code in this repository is authored for this project unless a file
header states otherwise.
